// A replace, not a workspace, for the reason browser/chrome gives: a
// go.work would pull this module's requirements into every `go` command run
// from the repo root. Consumers ignore it and resolve the require above,
// which has to name a published release containing ext.MCPPack.
replace github.com/mind-vm/thinking-core => ../..
